  <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">LinkedIn Profile Rubric</h2>
  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 15%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">BEGINNER</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">INTERMEDIATE</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">ADVANCED</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>PHOTO</strong></td>
        <td>No picture</td>
        <td>Cropped photo from personal life or "selfie"</td>
        <td>Professional-quality photo</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>HEADLINE</strong></td>
        <td>"Student at <span data-field="school_name">{{ school_name }}</span>"</td>
        <td>Expanded "Student at <span data-field="school_name">{{ school_name }}</span>" headline</td>
        <td>Engaging headline (120 characters or less) that highlights your career goals</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>SUMMARY</strong></td>
        <td>No or little summary provided</td>
        <td>Limited summary or tie in past experience(s)</td>
        <td>Summary briefly describes previous related experience or connects passion/ambition/goals to your career path</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>EXPERIENCE</strong></td>
        <td>No or very little descriptions for positions</td>
        <td>Descriptions lack detail, are unclear, and/or do not include accomplishments</td>
        <td>Full and detailed experiences from resume, including accomplishments at each job or activity</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>RECOMMENDATIONS</strong></td>
        <td>No recommendations</td>
        <td>1-2 recommendations from colleagues and/or classmates</td>
        <td>3+ recommendations listed. Recommendations from former managers or colleagues who can speak to your skills or projects highlighted</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>APPLICATIONS</strong></td>
        <td>No applications used</td>
        <td>1-2 applications used</td>
        <td>Relevant applications used to showcase skills and experience</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>SKILLS & EXPERTISE</strong></td>
        <td>No Skills & Expertise listed</td>
        <td>5-10 Skills & Expertise listed</td>
        <td>10+ Skills & Expertise listed (up to 50 are permitted)</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">EDUCATION</h2>
  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 15%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">BEGINNER</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">INTERMEDIATE</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">ADVANCED</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>ADDITIONAL INFO</strong></td>
        <td>No interests listed provided</td>
        <td>Interests are listed, but no other info is provided</td>
        <td>Interests are generic or specific; contacts specify info and circumstances for contact</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>CONNECTIONS</strong></td>
        <td>Little to no connections</td>
        <td>Approximately 50 connections</td>
        <td>100+ connections</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>GROUPS</strong></td>
        <td>No group membership</td>
        <td>Member of <span data-field="bryn_mawr_group_name">{{ bryn_mawr_group_name }}</span></td>
        <td>Member of <span data-field="bryn_mawr_group_name">{{ bryn_mawr_group_name }}</span> and/or other BMC alumnae</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>COMPANIES</strong></td>
        <td>Not following any companies</td>
        <td>Follows a few companies in industry</td>
        <td>Follows several companies in industry</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>OVERALL COMPLETENESS OF PROFILE</strong></td>
        <td>Profile has incorrect info, typos, or is out of date and few connections</td>
        <td>Profile provides some info, but does not provide an accurate picture of student's direction, interests, or experience. Some effort has been made to obtain recommendations</td>
        <td>Profile demonstrates a depth of understanding by providing completeness in all relevant fields. Many connections and recommendations for Skills & Expertise and recommendations</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

